ubind @omura
sensor x @unit @x
sensor y @unit @y
ulocate building turret true @copper outx outy found building
jump 21 equal found 0
op sub dx x outx
op sub dy y outy
op pow dx dx 2
op pow dy dy 2
op add t dx dy
op sqrt sqt t b
jump 21 greaterThan sqt 66
op sub xdiff x outx
op sub ydiff y outy
op div xfrac xdiff 15
op div yfrac ydiff 15
op add xt xfrac outx
op add yt yfrac outy
ucontrol stop outx outy 1 0 0
ucontrol target xt yt 1 0 0
end
ulocate building core true @copper xc yc found building
op sub dxx x xc
op sub dyy x yc
op pow dxx dxx 2
op pow dyy dyy 2
op add tt dyy dxx
op sqrt sqtt tt dxx
jump 32 greaterThan sqtt 66
ucontrol stop xc yc 1 0 0
ucontrol target xc yc 1 0 0
end
ucontrol pathfind xc yc 0 0 0
